        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Consequently, we continuously review capabilities and develop or acquire systems, processes and competencies to meet our unique business requirements, including strategic investments in cloud capabilities, machine learning and AI, emerging technologies and automation, and data analytics.",
